@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:——时间来到计划执行日的早晨。<br>艾玛在自己的牢房里坐起上半身。|#0102Adv16_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的脸上有几分阴郁。|#0102Adv16_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（明明今天是越狱的日子……<br>　可这内心的躁动是怎么一回事）|#0102Adv16_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 地下通路を走る音・2人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_49 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛忽然听见过道那边传来了奔跑的声音，<br>仿佛在呼应她不祥的预感。|#0102Adv16_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:冲进艾玛牢房的<br>是雪莉和汉娜。|#0102Adv16_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:两人都跑得上气不接下气，<br>面色铁青。|#0102Adv16_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，不、不、不好了！！|#0102Adv16_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发生什么事了！？|#0102Adv16_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:总、总之，你先过来！|#0102Adv16_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛立即下床，<br>跟着她们跑了起来。|#0102Adv16_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
