@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:18_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:天啊……|#0102Adv16_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛赶到现场后，<br>直接瘫坐在地。|#0102Adv16_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们努力做出来的……<br>可不是这样的东西……|#0102Adv16_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:到底是谁干的……|#0102Adv16_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:被撕得破破烂烂的碎布<br>散得满地都是。|#0102Adv16_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:载物篮也被拆得七零八散，<br>——热气球被无情地毁了个一干二净。|#0102Adv16_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他少女听见动静后<br>也都接连走了过来。|#0102Adv16_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:众人望着被毁得惨不忍睹的热气球，<br>不知所措地愣在原地。|#0102Adv16_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:残酷的现实摆在她们的面前。|#0102Adv16_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——越狱，失败了。|#0102Adv16_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:喂，大叔！|#0102Adv16_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆締め上げられて息が詰まる

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……|#0102Adv16_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙揪起米莉亚脖子上的丝带，<br>逼至跟前瞪着她。|#0102Adv16_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:应该只有你知道热气球藏在哪里才对，<br>难道是你干的！？|#0102Adv16_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0102Adv16_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:米、米莉亚小姐，请说点什么吧……<br>否则大家就会……|#0102Adv16_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ショックを隠せず震え声で

[PrintTextModified Text:真是你干的吗，大叔？<br>你可不像会干出这种离谱事的人啊。|#0102Adv16_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ショックを隠せず震え声で

[PrintTextModified Text:你真的，骗了我们……？|#0102Adv16_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真遗憾。|#0102Adv16_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（米莉亚怎么可能做出这种事，<br>　这不可……）|#0102Adv16_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的脑海里掠过米莉亚不经意间吐露的真心话——<br>“不想回去”。|#0102Adv16_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的嘴不停地一张一合——<br>可就是说不出维护米莉亚的话。|#0102Adv16_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，大家的手机收到了通知，<br>每个人都拿出自己的手机。|#0102Adv16_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『因收到监视猫头鹰的报告，<br>　现在此通知各位……』|#0102Adv16_Narrative018|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『佐伯米莉亚小姐<br>　曾于深夜门禁时间外出』|#0102Adv16_Narrative019|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『由于违反规定，<br>　现决定将其送往惩罚室……真遗憾』|#0102Adv16_Narrative020|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0102Adv16_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长的通知<br>仿佛印证了米莉亚的作案事实。|#0102Adv16_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:原来如此……你深夜跑出来<br>就是来这里破坏了热气球是吧。|#0102Adv16_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:太过分了！<br>你究竟为什么要这么做！？|#0102Adv16_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:“呵呵，啊哈哈！”<br>可可捧腹大笑起来。|#0102Adv16_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那还用说吗？因为大叔是幕后黑手啊。<br>她不想让我们逃走所以这么干了。|#0102Adv16_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆涙声でキレる

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我说得没错吧！？喂！！|#0102Adv16_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:不是……|#0102Adv16_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到可可欲哭无泪的样子，<br>米莉亚反驳的声音渐弱，无力地垂下脑袋。|#0102Adv16_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:……大家，对不起。|#0102Adv16_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小艾，抱歉……<br>明明你那么信任我。<br>真的很对不起。|#0102Adv16_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（原来真的是米莉亚<br>　毁掉了热气球啊……）|#0102Adv16_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，正如之前典狱长通知所说，<br>看守过来了。|#0102Adv16_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:它把米莉亚粗暴地抱了起来。|#0102Adv16_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
