[PrintTextModified Text:哇、哇啊，<br>住、住手……！|#0102Adv16_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不要去惩罚室！<br>谁来救救我……|#0102Adv16_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在看守的束缚下，<br>米莉亚面色惨白，表情因恐惧而狰狞。|#0102Adv16_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Miria-Front Loop:false
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，谁也没有对她伸出援手。<br>她们纷纷移开视线，低下了头。|#0102Adv16_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样，<br>看守将拼命挣扎的米莉亚带走了。|#0102Adv16_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚走后，<br>现场沉默了好一阵子。|#0102Adv16_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谁也没有说话，<br>唯有空虚的气氛占据全场。|#0102Adv16_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛紧紧握拳，抬起头。|#0102Adv16_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:（不能因为这点事就放弃！）|#0102Adv16_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:各位，虽然这次失败了，<br>但我们可以再做个热气球！|#0102Adv16_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也可以不做热气球，<br>而是去探索其他方法。|#0102Adv16_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不会放弃的！<br>我一定会和大家一起越狱！|#0102Adv16_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:就是啊！<br>想想看，我们还有亚里沙在。<br>只要再做个热气球就好了嘛！|#0102Adv16_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:请不要把话说得那么轻松。<br>你知道我这段时间有多辛苦吗……|#0102Adv16_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不过，艾玛说得没错。<br>我也不想放弃。|#0102Adv16_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:热气球被毁掉了，重新做一个就好。<br>无论做多少次我都奉陪到底，哼。|#0102Adv16_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，雪莉，<br>谢谢你们……|#0102Adv16_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽说有点失望，<br>不过也罢，我们重新制定作战计划吧。|#0102Adv16_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。各位，<br>我们先回一趟会客厅吧。|#0102Adv16_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管少女们有些垂头丧气，<br>但她们还是迈着无力的步伐走了起来。|#0102Adv16_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……安安小姐？<br>你怎么了，身体又不舒服吗……？|#0102Adv16_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听见梅露露的声音，<br>走在前面的艾玛回过头来。|#0102Adv16_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:安安正瘫坐在<br>被粉碎得不成样的热气球旁。|#0102Adv16_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Angry1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

; 地面を殴る音・弱
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_50 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:她怒视着地面，<br>一拳又一拳地狠狠捶地。|#0102Adv16_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_50 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:像是发自肺腑地感到不甘心。|#0102Adv16_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:心情很难平复吧。<br>我也特别不甘心。|#0102Adv16_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（安安……）|#0102Adv16_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安小姐……我们回去吧？<br>你这样会受伤的……一起回去吧……？|#0102Adv16_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露轻轻抚摸她的背，<br>但她就是坐在原地不动。|#0102Adv16_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

