@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:本来还打算在会客厅开个作战会议，<br>但痛失热气球的无力感久久挥之不去。|#0102Adv16_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:最后还是很快就解散了，<br>于是艾玛回到自己的牢房。|#0102Adv16_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（米莉亚……<br>　你为什么要这么做？）|#0102Adv16_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（明明热气球是我们的希望，<br>　亚里沙也答应帮我们了……<br>　明明我们这次终于有机会逃出去了）|#0102Adv16_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚被关进了惩罚室。<br>艾玛回想起以前偷偷看过<br>惩罚室里的模样。|#0102Adv16_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我记得，那里放了很多拷问用具……<br>　希望她不要受到太过分的对待……）|#0102Adv16_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（要不要去看看情况……？可是……<br>　我不知道该对米莉亚<br>　说些什么……）|#0102Adv16_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:期望越大，<br>失望也就越深。|#0102Adv16_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛蜷缩起身子，<br>准备入睡。|#0102Adv16_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:10,70 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Middle

